<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Pekelink — Un link para todo lo tuyo</title>
<meta name="description" content="Pekelink: tu minisite con todos tus links y códigos QR que redirigen a tus PDFs, catálogos y redes, todo en un solo lugar." />
<style>
  :root {
    --c-purple: #6d3bff;
    --c-blue: #1f6feb;
    --c-coral: #ff4d6d;
    --c-cream: #f2efe4;
    --c-ink: #121212;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    background: #fff;
  }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  img, .mockup { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

  .nav-wrap { position: sticky; top: 16px; z-index: 50; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 0 16px; }
  nav.pill {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 10px 10px 10px 24px;
  }
  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .logo .dot { color: var(--c-coral); }
  .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .btn-pill {
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-ghost { background: #efefef; color: #111; }
  .btn-dark { background: var(--c-ink); color: #fff; }
  .burger { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: #efefef; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.1rem; }

  .block { width: 100%; padding: 90px 6vw; }
  .block-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .block-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .block { padding: 64px 6vw; } }
  .block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .block p { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.9; max-width: 480px; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.5; }

  .block.hero { background: var(--c-purple); color: #fff; padding-top: 48px; }
  .block.blue { background: var(--c-blue); color: #fff; }
  .block.coral { background: var(--c-coral); color: #fff; }
  .block.cream { background: var(--c-cream); color: var(--c-ink); }

  .cta-lime { background: #d7ff3e; color: #111; }
  .cta-white { background: #fff; color: #111; }
  .cta-dark { background: #111; color: #fff; }

  .phone {
    width: 230px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #0d0d14;
    border-radius: 36px;
    padding: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  .phone .screen {
    background: #1a1a24;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    min-height: 360px;
  }
  .phone .avatar { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-purple), var(--c-coral)); margin: 0 auto 10px; }
  .phone h4 { color: #fff; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .phone p.sub { color: #9b9bab; text-align: center; font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .phone .link-row { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }

  .stat-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .cream .stat-card { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  .stat-card .big { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; }

  footer { background: #111; color: #eee; padding: 64px 6vw 32px; }
  .footer-grid { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .footer-grid h5 { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.6; margin-bottom: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .footer-grid a { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: 0.9; }
  .footer-bottom {
    max-width: 1100px; margin: 48px auto 0; padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
  }
  .socials { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .socials a { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .legal-band { background: #3c1a66; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center; padding: 20px 6vw; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <nav class="pill">
      <div class="logo">Peke<span class="dot">•</span>link</div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="btn-pill btn-ghost" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Iniciar sesión</a>
        <a class="btn-pill btn-dark" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Crear gratis</a>
        <div class="burger">☰</div>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <section class="block hero">
    <div class="block-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Un link<br/>para todo<br/>lo tuyo.</h2>
        <p>Sumate a los negocios que usan Pekelink para compartir su catálogo, redes y contacto desde un solo enlace o un solo QR.</p>
        <a class="btn-pill cta-lime" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Empezar gratis</a>
      </div>
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="avatar"></div>
          <h4>Tu Negocio</h4>
          <p class="sub">link.pekelink.com/tu-negocio</p>
          <div class="link-row">📄 Catálogo (PDF)</div>
          <div class="link-row">📷 Instagram</div>
          <div class="link-row">🛒 Tienda online</div>
          <div class="link-row">📱 WhatsApp</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block blue">
    <div class="block-inner">
      <div style="order:2">
        <h2>Armá tu Pekelink<br/>en minutos.</h2>
        <p>Mandanos tu logo, tus links y tu catálogo. Nosotros armamos tu minisite y tu QR, listos para imprimir o compartir el mismo día.</p>
        <a class="btn-pill cta-white" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Quiero el mío</a>
      </div>
      <div style="order:1; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px;">
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="big">⚡ 24h</div>entrega</div>
        <div class="stat-card" style="margin-top:40px;"><div class="big">🔳 QR</div>a tu PDF</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block coral">
    <div class="block-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Conectá todo tu<br/>contenido en un<br/>solo link.</h2>
        <p>Redes sociales, catálogo, menú, WhatsApp, tienda — todo en una página clara, rápida y con tu marca.</p>
        <a class="btn-pill cta-dark" href="https://link.pekelink.com/demo">Ver demo en vivo</a>
      </div>
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="avatar"></div>
          <h4>Ejemplo Pekelink</h4>
          <p class="sub">qr.pekelink.com/tu-negocio</p>
          <div class="link-row">🔗 Minisite</div>
          <div class="link-row">📄 PDF directo</div>
          <div class="link-row">🎯 Redirección instantánea</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block cream">
    <div class="block-inner">
      <div style="order:2">
        <h2>Pensado para<br/>negocios reales.</h2>
        <p>Sin apps que instalar ni paneles complicados. Vos nos mandás la info, nosotros publicamos y mantenemos tu Pekelink.</p>
        <a class="btn-pill" style="background:var(--c-ink); color:#fff;" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Hablemos</a>
      </div>
      <div style="order:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; max-width:320px;">
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="big">📄 → 🔳</div>PDF a QR en un paso</div>
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="big">🎨</div>Diseño a tu marca</div>
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="big">🌐</div>Tu propio subdominio</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <h5>Producto</h5>
        <a href="https://link.pekelink.com/demo">Ver demo</a>
        <a href="#">Minisites</a>
        <a href="#">Códigos QR</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>Empresa</h5>
        <a href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Contacto</a>
        <a href="#">Sobre Pekelink</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>Recursos</h5>
        <a href="#">Preguntas frecuentes</a>
        <a href="#">Soporte</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>Empezar</h5>
        <a class="btn-pill cta-lime" style="display:inline-block;" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Crear mi Pekelink</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© <%= year %> Pekelink</span>
      <div class="socials">
        <a href="#">in</a>
        <a href="#">ig</a>
        <a href="#">tt</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <div class="legal-band">Pekelink · Minisites y códigos QR para negocios · pekelink.com</div>

</body>
</html>
